WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.400
The platform should
outlast a particular model.

00:00:02.576 --> 00:00:07.120
Team workflows connect to approved
context, bounded execution,

00:00:07.167 --> 00:00:11.600
independent checks and retained
evidence through replaceable adapters.

00:00:11.670 --> 00:00:14.320
Release authority stays
with accountable owners.

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:17.360
Reviewed failures improve
the regression corpus.

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:21.920
This separation lets the institution
change models and tools without losing

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:25.600
its quality contracts or history.
The strategic asset

00:00:25.733 --> 00:00:29.360
is the ability to evaluate
and operate the workflow consistently.
